          "name": "map-data-lbrut",
          "notes": "This service provides access toa  wide range of map data provided by teh London Borough of Richmond upon Thames.\n\nIt includes \n\n1) The Local Plan which  sets out the priorities for the development of the borough of LBRUT and will be used for making decisions on planning applications. It consists of a number of planning documents and guidance.\n2) Community Infrastructure Levy zones - banded areas for this levy.\n3)  Schools - a copy of the DofEducation data within LBRUT\n4)  Conservation Areas",
